Habitica sprites: CC BY-NC-SA 3.0, (c) HabitRPG, Inc.

The images in this folder are Habitica's avatar, gear, pet and mount art,
by HabitRPG, Inc. and the volunteer artists who assigned their work to it.
They are copied byte for byte from Habitica's public image host
(https://habitica-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/mobileApp/images/), unmodified;
manifest.json records each file's source URL and checksum.

They are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-
ShareAlike 3.0 Unported licence (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/
Habitica's own licence statement:
https://github.com/HabitRPG/habitica/blob/develop/LICENSE

What that means here:
- Credit: HabitRPG, Inc. (https://habitica.com), with a link to the licence.
- Non-commercial: anyone who copies these files, or runs a Glimway server that
  serves them (from this folder or from the server's sprite cache), must not
  do so in a way primarily intended for or directed toward commercial
  advantage or private monetary compensation. This limit applies to this art,
  not to Glimway's code (AGPL-3.0-or-later) or its own art (CC0).
- ShareAlike: a changed version of any of these images must carry the same
  licence. Glimway only draws them as they are, layered the way Habitica does.

